。會暑溼，士卒大疫，兵不能踰嶺。歲餘，高后崩，即罷兵。佗因此以兵威邊，財物賂遺閩越、西甌、駱，役屬焉，東西萬餘里。乃乘黃屋左纛，稱制，與中國侔。","scope":"received_title_attestation","image_verified":false},{"kind":"longluzao","title":"《前漢書》卷九十五古注（文淵閣數位轉錄）","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0007/blob/683113d4baf6febecaf2ccb7913df87c4d68d454/KR2a0007_095.txt#L190-L192","raw_quote":"兵攻長沙邊敗數縣焉髙后遣將軍隆慮侯竈擊之(師/古)¶\n(曰周竈也/慮音廬)會暑溼士卒大疫兵不能隃領(師古曰隃與/踰同下皆類)¶\n(此/)嵗餘髙后崩即罷兵佗因此以兵威財物賂遺閩粤¶","source_blob_sha":"b41576d7d677e481940c3a7f222a09837c85e8f7","response_sha256":"ae85076fbcb902242dad85fc3d8b11751e408d228b939c73e8f4c3ee4a879793","response_extent":{"first_line":151,"last_line":300,"partial_file":true},"image_verified":false,"quote":"師古曰周竈也","scope":"ancient_commentary_identity_or_name_components","note":"短引文只除分行、雙行注斜線、括號、段末符與頁標；保留原字。部分回應指紋非全檔hash，Git blob另列。古注亦非影像校勘。"}],"note":"姓名周灶據本格，隆慮侯據本傳；古注作周竈分源保留，非改名年表。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m002-0109","start":109,"end":110,"surface":"灶","kind":"person","person_id":"cnz_t0f_oaz","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p002","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m013-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"隆慮","kind":"person","person_id":"cnz_t0f_oaz","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p013","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji113-007","person_id":"cnz_t0f_oaz","title":"將軍","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p002","quote":"高后時，有司請禁南越關市鐵器。佗曰：「高帝立我，通使物，今高後聽讒臣，別異蠻夷，隔絕器物，此必長沙王計也，欲倚中國，擊滅南越而并王之，自為功也。」於是佗乃自尊號為南越武帝，發兵攻長沙邊邑，敗數縣而去焉。高後遣將軍隆慮侯灶往擊之。會暑溼，士卒大疫，兵不能踰嶺。歲餘，高后崩，即罷兵。佗因此以兵威邊，財物賂遺閩越、西甌、駱，役屬焉，東西萬餘里。乃乘黃屋左纛，稱制，與中國侔。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji113-007:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p002","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"將軍","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyu