溼，士卒大疫，兵不能踰嶺。歲餘，高后崩，即罷兵。佗因此以兵威邊，財物賂遺閩越、西甌、駱，役屬焉，東西萬餘里。乃乘黃屋左纛，稱制，與中國侔。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m002-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"高后","kind":"person","person_id":"i30_mjq_6q8_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m002-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"佗","kind":"person","person_id":"bvb_d1z_fd0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m002-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m002-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"高後","kind":"person","person_id":"i30_mjq_6q8_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m002-0047","start":47,"end":50,"surface":"長沙王","kind":"person","person_id":"8ip_ubw_ssk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m002-0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"佗","kind":"person","person_id":"bvb_d1z_fd0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m002-0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"高後","kind":"person","person_id":"i30_mjq_6q8_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m002-0109","start":109,"end":110,"surface":"灶","kind":"person","person_id":"cnz_t0f_oaz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m002-0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"高后","kind":"person","person_id":"i30_mjq_6q8_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m002-0140","start":140,"end":141,"surface":"佗","kind":"person","person_id":"bvb_d1z_fd0","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","book_id":"b-shiji-113","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p013","text":"尉佗之王，本由任囂。遭漢初定，列為諸侯。隆慮離溼疫，佗得以益驕。甌駱相攻，南越動搖。漢兵臨境，嬰齊入朝。其後亡國，徵自樛女；呂嘉小忠，令佗無後。樓船從欲，怠傲失惑；伏波困窮，智慮愈殖，因禍為福。成敗之轉，譬若糾墨。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-