work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-113","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue","source_revision":8735632,"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p002","person_id":"cnz_t0f_oaz","quote":"高后時，有司請禁南越關市鐵器。佗曰：「高帝立我，通使物，今高後聽讒臣，別異蠻夷，隔絕器物，此必長沙王計也，欲倚中國，擊滅南越而并王之，自為功也。」於是佗乃自尊號為南越武帝，發兵攻長沙邊邑，敗數縣而去焉。高後遣將軍隆慮侯灶往擊之。會暑溼，士卒大疫，兵不能踰嶺。歲餘，高后崩，即罷兵。佗因此以兵威邊，財物賂遺閩越、西甌、駱，役屬焉，東西萬餘里。乃乘黃屋左纛，稱制，與中國侔。"}]}],"table_id":"shiji-018","table_fragment_id":"shiji-018-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-018-t1-r026","table_cell_id":"shiji-018-t1-r026-c02","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-018","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-018","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-018","source_revision":"9484995","source_header":["國名。","侯功","高祖十二","孝惠七","高后八","孝文二十三","孝景十六","孝武五十四","侯第"],"row_year":null}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-095","source_id":"s-shiji-095-fankuang","source":{"title":"史記／卷095","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷095","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷095&oldid=2298709","revision_id":2298709,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"34段傳世正文含太史公論，另附1段分層索隱述贊；排除導覽與空白。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"固定HTML一致，只去外緣空白；樊噌、（肩）［屏］、（博）［傅］、（太卜）太仆、穎陰等原字保留。","note":"全37個HTML區塊已讀，未核底本影像。"}}},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-113","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue","source":{"title":"史記／卷113","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷113","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷113&oldid=8735632","revision_id":8735632,"accessed_on":"2026-10-11","extent":"固定數位見證14段，末段索隱述贊分層。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalizat